{
  "_comment": [
    "System 層（EffectPerf）：身份、開機行為、NC4 通道與路由表（S3-Matrix）。",
    "這個 project 只跑 nc4＋effect_bench；render／pixel 在 tasks.json 是 -1，不會初始化 I80。",
    "frame_interval_ms／num_pixels 保留給同板其他 project 的預置值，effect_bench 不讀它們。",
    "USB：hardware phy=otg-fs（GPIO19/20）；link {kind:\"usb\",index:0,msc:1}：personality 由 USB.list[0].phy 決定（otg-fs → cdc，MSC 可行）。",
    "links[].name：可省略或用 \"name\":\"\" → 自動生成；有非空 name 就用。links[].msc：USB link 的 MSC 開關（只 OTG）。",
    "links[].rx 唔寫 = 用固件預設；只有特殊負載才覆寫。"
  ],
  "version": 1,
  "cID": "",
  "frame_interval_ms": 20,
  "num_pixels": 64,
  "nc4": {
    "links": [
      {
        "name": "usb0",
        "kind": "usb",
        "index": 0,
        "msc": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "wifi_tcp0",
        "kind": "wifi_tcp",
        "index": 0,
        "port": 80
      },
      {
        "name": "wifi_tcp1",
        "kind": "wifi_tcp",
        "index": 1,
        "port": 6000
      },
      {
        "name": "wifi_tcp2",
        "kind": "wifi_tcp",
        "index": 2,
        "port": 8080
      },
      {
        "name": "wifi_udp0",
        "kind": "wifi_udp",
        "index": 0,
        "port": 6001
      }
    ],
    "routes": [
      {
        "in": "nctx",
        "out": [
          "decode0"
        ]
      },
      {
        "in": "outbound",
        "out": []
      },
      {
        "in": "usb0",
        "out": [
          "decode0"
        ]
      },
      {
        "in": "wifi_tcp1",
        "out": [
          "decode0"
        ]
      },
      {
        "in": "wifi_tcp2",
        "out": [
          "decode0"
        ]
      },
      {
        "in": "wifi_udp0",
